n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Alive</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occupation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Head of the <a href=\"/wiki/Azure_Masks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Azure Masks\">Azure Masks</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">The Order of St. George</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"house\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">House</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mask\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Mask</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Azure Mask\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/1/13/Azure_Mask.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20241130215647\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"27\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Azure Mask.png\" data-image-key=\"Azure_Mask.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></span></span> — <a href=\"/wiki/Azure_Mask\" title=\"Azure Mask\">Azure</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"position\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Position</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Council member</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"totem\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Totem</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unnamed golden bull</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Order_of_St._George\" title=\"The Order of St. George\">The Order of St. George</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatives\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Relatives</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li>Unnamed father</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_5\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 5\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #5</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"House of Slaughter 28 (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSG91c2Vfb2ZfU2xhdWdodGVyXzI4P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\"><i>House of Slaughter</i> #28</span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Buck Slaughter</b> <i>(current aliases unknown)</i><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-HOS28&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-HOS28-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> is the Head of the <a href=\"/wiki/Azure_Masks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Azure Masks\">Azure Masks</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a> under <a href=\"/wiki/The_Order_of_St._George\" title=\"The Order of St. George\">The Order of St. George</a>. He was formerly the working partner of <a href=\"/wiki/Gary_Slaughter\" title=\"Gary Slaughter\">Gary Slaughter</a> at <span class=\"new\" title=\"Gary&#39;s Farm (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvR2FyeSUyN3NfRmFybT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">the Farm</span> around the year 2000, before moving up in the ranks enough that by 2020 he was the leader of his branch of the house. He is known to rarely speak, and as a <a href=\"/wiki/Totem\" title=\"Totem\">totem</a> of a golden bull plush toy.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Physical_appearance\">Physical appearance</span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>Buck was the child of a cello or bass player in the Kansas City Orchestra, and received a toy golden bull to match its symbol. His family originates from the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Alabaster Masks (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQWxhYmFzdGVyX01hc2tzP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Alabaster Masks</span> of the <span class=\"new\" title=\"New York House (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTmV3X1lvcmtfSG91c2U/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">New York House</span>, along with <span class=\"new\" title=\"Gerde Slaughter (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvR2VyZGVfU2xhdWdodGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Gerde Slaughter</span>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-HOS28&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-HOS28-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> For a time, he worked with <a href=\"/wiki/Gary_Slaughter\" title=\"Gary Slaughter\">Gary Slaughter</a> on <span class=\"new\" title=\"Gary&#39;s Farm (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvR2FyeSUyN3NfRmFybT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">the Farm</span>, raising monsters and working espionage for the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC18&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC18-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>By the year 2020, Buck had ascended the ranks to become the head of the Azure Masks of the House of Slaughter.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC5&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC5-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>More TBA</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_5\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 5\">Issue #5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_18\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 18\">Issue #18</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_20\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 20\">Issue #20</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"House_of_Slaughter\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter_(comic_series)\" title=\"House of Slaughter (comic series)\">House of Slaughter</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"House of Slaughter 26 (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSG91c2Vfb2ZfU2xhdWdodGVyXzI2P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Issue #26</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"House of Slaughter 27 (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSG91c2Vfb2ZfU2xhdWdodGVyXzI3P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Issue #27</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"House of Slaughter 28 (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSG91c2Vfb2ZfU2xhdWdodGVyXzI4P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Issue #28</span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"f5e8c1aaef3b3a656fc583a2ce311a87\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:160px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Order_of_St_George-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:146px; width:185px; top:6px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Order_of_St_George.jpg\" title=\"Order of St George.jpg (938 KB)\" style=\"height:146px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/b/bd/Order_of_St_George.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20230228161949\" title=\"Order of St George.jpg (938 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"With the Council, Something Is Killing the Children Issue #5\" height=\"158\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Order of St George.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Order_of_St_George.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"With the Council, &lt;i&gt;Something Is Killing the Children&lt;/i&gt; \"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAA